abstract: Satya is an offline-first retrieval-augmented-generation (RAG)
  learning companion for Nepal (NEB) Grades 8-12, optimized to run on
  4GB-RAM CPU-only hardware. It combines a Phi-1.5 GGUF model runtime, a
  semantic cache, an ASCII diagram engine, and rule-based input
  normalization to give students printable-quality explanations without
  internet access.
